<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Estructura de red — Adaria Vera' }) %>
<h1>Estructura de red</h1>
<p class="muted">Inventario editable de toda la red (sondeo vía VPN). Los cambios se guardan en <b>este navegador</b>. Usa Exportar/Importar JSON para compartirlos.</p>

<div class="estred">
  <div class="er-bar">
    <button class="er-b er-primary" onclick="erSave()">💾 Guardar</button>
    <button class="er-b er-ghost" onclick="erExport()">⬇️ Exportar JSON</button>
    <button class="er-b er-ghost" onclick="document.getElementById('erImp').click()">⬆️ Importar</button>
    <input type="file" id="erImp" hidden accept="application/json" onchange="erImport(event)">
    <button class="er-b er-ghost" onclick="window.print()">🖨️ Imprimir</button>
    <button class="er-b er-accent" onclick="erReset()">↺ Restaurar</button>
    <span class="er-status" id="erStatus"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="er-note"><b>⚠️</b> VPN (<code>adrariavera</code>=192.168.1.101) solo enruta <code>192.168.1.0/24</code>; la red <code>50.50.0.0/24</code> (WiFi/CCTV/tel. analógica) NO es accesible en remoto y es IP pública mal usada. Telefonía (UCM6202 + Vega 50 + teléfonos) con contraseñas cambiadas por el proveedor saliente y no entregadas.</div>
  <div id="erApp"></div>
</div>

<style>
.estred .er-bar{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:12px 0}
.estred .er-b{font-size:13px;border:none;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;cursor:pointer}
.estred .er-primary{background:#1b5e75;color:#fff}.estred .er-ghost{background:#d4e9f3;color:#1b5e75}.estred .er-accent{background:#c67c6f;color:#fff}
.estred .er-status{font-size:12px;color:#a0a2a5;margin-left:auto}
.estred .er-note{background:#fff;border-left:4px solid #f39c12;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:13px}
.estred .er-group{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08);margin-bottom:20px;overflow:hidden}
.estred .er-group>h2{margin:0;padding:12px 18px;font-size:16px;color:#fff}
.estred .g-acceso>h2{background:#4a9b8e}.estred .g-red>h2{background:#1b5e75}.estred .g-srv>h2{background:#2d8aa3}
.estred .g-tel>h2{background:#c67c6f}.estred .g-fon>h2{background:#b06a5e}.estred .g-cctv>h2{background:#6a5acd}
.estred .g-pc>h2{background:#5ba8c7}.estred .g-otros>h2{background:#d4b8a3;color:#333}
.estred table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
.estred th{background:#d4e9f3;color:#1b5e75;text-align:left;padding:8px 10px;font-size:12px}
.estred td{border-bottom:1px solid #eee;padding:6px 10px;vertical-align:top}
.estred td[contenteditable]:focus{outline:2px solid #5ba8c7;background:#fffef7}
.estred .er-del{color:#e74c3c;cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;padding:0 6px}
.estred .er-add{width:100%;background:#f8f9fa;color:#1b5e75;border:none;border-top:1px dashed #5ba8c7;padding:8px;cursor:pointer}
@media print{.estred .er-bar,.estred .er-add,.estred .er-del{display:none}}
</style>

